    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00648",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "女人还是不说话，只顾一个劲儿地打抖。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The woman still said nothing, only kept trembling uncontrollably.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00648",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "恐怕她洞悉一切吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She probably knew everything, he thought.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00648",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "总之，她摆出一副受害者的面孔，其实是同谋犯。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In any case, she wore the face of a victim, but in truth she was an accomplice.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00648",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "难受也活该！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If she was suffering, she deserved it!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00648",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "……这些痛苦当然该受报复。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "... Naturally, these sufferings deserved to be avenged.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
